t of direct investments are not implemented as proposed, affecting Sweden's ability to use trade policy for environmental and climate objectives."}, "subtopics": ["handelspolitik", "miljö", "klimat", "mänskliga rättigheter", "företagsansvar"], "parties_involved": ["S", "C"]}}